DICAM Network Vendoring Notice
================================

Source: https://github.com/hfarhaditolie/DICAM
Commit: c0dba84931533c64eb8597782cf012f4c2a4e6eb
License: MIT (see LICENSE file)

Classes Included:
- Inc: Inception-like module with multiple convolution branches
- Flatten: Flattening layer for channel attention
- CAM: Channel Attention Module
- DICAM: Main network architecture for underwater image enhancement

Input/Output Specification:
- Input: RGB tensor in range [0, 1], shape (N, 3, H, W)
- Output: RGB tensor in range [0, 1], shape (N, 3, H, W)
- Network is fully convolutional with no spatial downsampling (all convolutions and pooling use stride 1)
- Accepts any H×W dimensions (no divisibility requirements)

Checkpoint Loading:
- Checkpoints are loaded with key 'model_state_dict' via torch.load()
- Example: torch.load('DICAM_60.pt')['model_state_dict']

Interface:
- build_default_network(): Returns a DICAM() instance ready for inference
